{"id":"n26908-1-2","stage":1,"title":"팔십 · 八十","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26908-1-2-1","ko":"키가 꽤 커 보이는데 얼마나 되니?","zh":"你看着个子挺高，有多高？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"키가","meaning":"高，高度","explanation":"키：高，高度；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"2","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"키가","audio":"/audio/26f2f72df3c979a9df96.mp3"}},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}},{"text":"커","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커","audio":"/audio/768798e62994baaa085d.mp3"}},{"text":"보이는데","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이는데","audio":"/audio/9605d72ec6eda39718b1.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"되니?","meaning":"为","explanation":"되다：为；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL K